# Wandering Souls (outlands 161): the Cermet Headstone in Cape Teriggan (no script; the default CANNOT_REMOVE_FRAG;
# Rhapsodies of Zilart 5's monument: not current here). A level 75 Warrior, no Zilart mission, two Rain Lilies, a Bone
# Chip. Available: the headstone: the default; a lily: no section: nothing. Accepted (a GM): MUST_BE_A_WAY_TO_SOOTHE; the
# chip: nil: nothing; a lily with the chip: not exactly: nothing; two lilies: not exactly: nothing; a lily: 202 (the
# lily); finished with a full inventory: complete false: the lily kept; freed: 202, finished: completed (the Flagellant's
# Rope, Bearer of Bonds Beyond Time), the lily taken (confirmTrade). Completed: the default; a lily: nothing.
lists CapeTeriggan/Cermet_Headstone/onTrigger CapeTeriggan/Cermet_Headstone/onTrade CapeTeriggan/onEventFinish/202
char zone=CapeTeriggan pos=-108.084,-8.841,453.989 job=WAR lvl=75
item RainLily x2
item BoneChip
login
trigger Cermet_Headstone                # no section: the default CANNOT_REMOVE_FRAG
trade Cermet_Headstone RainLily x1      # no section: nothing
quest Outlands.WanderingSouls accepted  # a GM
trigger Cermet_Headstone                # MUST_BE_A_WAY_TO_SOOTHE
trade Cermet_Headstone BoneChip x1      # not the lily: nothing
trade Cermet_Headstone RainLily x1 BoneChip x1   # not exactly: nothing
trade Cermet_Headstone RainLily x2      # two lilies: not exactly: nothing
trade Cermet_Headstone RainLily x1      # 202 (the lily)
fill-inventory
finish                                  # complete false: the lily kept
free-inventory
trade Cermet_Headstone RainLily x1      # 202
finish                                  # completed: the rope, the title; the lily taken
trigger Cermet_Headstone                # completed: the default
trade Cermet_Headstone RainLily x1      # nothing
